 priv:{h:"Privacy in plain words",b:["We save the answers you give, the language, whether your screen is small or large, which sections you opened and how long tasks took.","We do not ask for your name, email, phone, location, bank, card or health information. Please do not type any in comment boxes.","We give your browser a random reference so your answers stay together. It is not linked to who you are.","Photos are never uploaded. If you try the photo option, it is read inside your browser tab and discarded.","Your connection address is only used to limit abuse and is stored as a short one-way code that expires within hours.","To delete your answers, use the button on the last step. Answers are kept only for this design review and removed when it ends."],close:"Close"},
 foot:"RYVANO early design preview. Concepts are not promises. Sample data only."
},
